      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_39",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "filter_condition",
            children: [
              {
                tag: "predicate",
                name: "wml_filter",
                unit: "$last_dead_id",
                filter: "%7B%22tag%22%3A%22filter%22%2C%22attributes%22%3A%7B%22id%22%3A%22Kestrel%22%7D%2C%22children%22%3A%5B%5D%7D",
              },
            ],
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_40",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            text: _("Who are you? What are you?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kestrel",
            text: _("We... are accursed. We were the soldiers of Prince Eldred, the King’s son and betrayer... when the Prince stooped to black magic, we were damned... those of us who bore witness were warped into these twisted forms."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Kestrel",
            text: _("The Queen sent us away... sent us west. Now, our mortal bodies pass... into another plane of hellish existence..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:fire_event",
            event: "branch_if_41",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Kestrel",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Maddock",
            text: _("Such is the price for treachery."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("Maddock, we helped you defend your city. Will you help us now?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Maddock",
            text: _("..."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Maddock",
            text: _("<i>Listen carefully. I shall not openly speak against Asheviere seeing as some of her spies are in the city... however, rest assured, I certainly do not trust the Queen and her questionable tactics.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("<i>What can ya offer us then?</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Lord Maddock",
            text: _("<i>Well, I do not normally make my relationship with them known, but I can make an exception. Southeast of here, in Carcyn, you may find assistance from one of my... contacts. Their methods should be better suited to your needs. As for your homes, I cannot offer you protection against Weldyn, but I can arrange for some roads to be closed to delay their patrols. That is the most I can do for you.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("<i>Hmph. Clear that you won’t help us fight, but I gots no more time to be stayin’ here. If we is going to resist the Crown a second time, we needs ourselves a good plan. Hope that you’re not sending us to our deaths, Maddock.</i>"),
          },
          {
            tag: "win",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_42",
        on: "time_over",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Baldras",
            text: _("More troops be coming from the south! With all them reinforcements, we gots no chance to defend Elensefar!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "lose",
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_43",
        on: "defeat",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("Asheviere’s armies assembled and struck before the nascent rebellion could even be planned. Without the necessary forces, Annuvin soon fell under Weldyn’s absolute control."),
          },
        ],
      },
      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_44",
        on: "last_breath",
        once: true,
        children: [
